docs {
  # DocumentsService.TrackDocument

  Public: a document by its tracking code, pointing at the version of a verification code

  `/ltedu.documents.v1.DocumentsService/TrackDocument` · unary · `ltedu/documents/v1/documents.proto`

  ## Request — `TrackDocumentRequest`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `tracking_code` | `string` |  |
  | `code` | `string` | A version's or a signature's verification code (optional) |

  ## Response — `TrackDocumentResponse`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `document` | `IssuedDocument` |  |
  | `matched` | `int32` | Number of the version the code belongs to; 0 when none was given or it is unknown |

  ## Tipos

  ### `IssuedDocument`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `id` | `string` |  |
  | `title` | `string` |  |
  | `tracking_code` | `string` |  |
  | `tracking_url` | `string` |  |
  | `mode` | `string` | section \| grade \| teacher \| general, and the target (empty: all) |
  | `target_id` | `string` |  |
  | `versions` | `repeated DocumentVersion` |  |
  | `events` | `repeated DocumentEvent` |  |
  | `institution_name` | `string` |  |

  ### `DocumentVersion`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `id` | `string` |  |
  | `number` | `int32` |  |
  | `verification_code` | `string` |  |
  | `status` | `string` | pending \| published \| superseded \| cancelled |
  | `note` | `string` |  |
  | `created_name` | `string` |  |
  | `created_at` | `string` |  |
  | `published_at` | `string` |  |
  | `signatures` | `repeated Signature` |  |
  | `content_hash` | `string` |  |

  ### `Signature`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `sort` | `int32` |  |
  | `staff_id` | `string` |  |
  | `name` | `string` |  |
  | `position` | `string` |  |
  | `signed_at` | `string` | RFC 3339; empty while waiting |
  | `code` | `string` |  |

  ### `DocumentEvent`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `version` | `int32` |  |
  | `action` | `string` | generated \| signed \| published \| superseded \| cancelled \| signers (the signers of a pending version changed) |
  | `actor` | `string` |  |
  | `note` | `string` |  |
  | `at` | `string` |  |

  Errores: status gRPC con un `ltedu.common.v1.ErrorDetail` (code, message, fields) en los details.
